{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he saw the Kenite.</b> The family of Jethro, as it is written (I Chronicles 2:55) ״המה הקינים״, and it is written (Judges 4:11) ״וחבר הקיני״. And 'set your nest in the rock' (שים בסלע קנך) — because his name was Kenite, his nest (קן) was invoked in his parable; that is, even if you were to set your dwelling strong and high like a bird's nest, from there you will descend."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:50.010298862Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}